2 _MARNM Hauge
1 NAME Major Oscar Coleman Hauge, Jr.
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 2 FEB 1920
2 ADDR
3 CITY Havre
3 STAE MT
3 CTRY United States
1 BURI
2 DATE ABT 2009
2 PLAC National Memorial Cemetery of the Pacific
2 ADDR
3 CITY Honolulu
3 STAE Hawaii
3 CTRY United States
