1 NOTE Roots Web:
2 CONT
2 CONT # ID: I628567420
2 CONT # Name: Frank Albert TIBBETTS
2 CONT # Given Name: Frank Albert
2 CONT # Surname: Tibbetts
2 CONT # Sex: M
2 CONT # Birth: 18 Jan 1896 in West Concord, Minnesota
2 CONT # Death: 29 Jul 1962 in SanLuisObispo, California
2 CONT # Note:
2 CONT
2 CONT     [tibbetts.GED]
2 CONT     A Soldier in WW 1, he served as a Medical Technician in Ft. Lewis Wa
2 CONT     doing Sputum tests for TB, and contracted the disease in the process. The
2 CONT     infection was detected early on, and a cure was affected prior to his
2 CONT     discharge at wars end.He was the only sibling to get to College, and
2 CONT     worked his way thru the U of Minn. by bussing dishes in Frat. Houses. He
2 CONT     got a Batchelors degree, and was credentialed as a Teacher of Vocational
2 CONT     Agriculture. While attending the U of M,
2 CONT     me met a PK (Preachers Kid) by the name of Lucile Lyda Berger, a cute,
2 CONT     headstrong Co-Ed of very German persuasion. Her father, the Rev. J.J.
2 CONT     Berger at that time , had the largest German Language Congregation west
2 CONT     of the Mississipi., the Methodist Episcopal Church in St Paul Minn.They
2 CONT     were an unlikley couple, he a 5'11" country bumpkin, who played a little
2 CONT     2nd string football, and she a 4'13" city bred sophisticate who played
2 CONT     piano, but unlikely or not, it was a true love match, ended much too
2 CONT     soon in 1962 by an automobile accident that took my fathers life .
2 CONT     Not only was Frank a Soldier, in WW1, but both of their children served
2 CONT     in WW II
2 CONT     Reed in the Army Air Corp/Force, and Patricia in the Navy. In addition
2 CONT     Reed married Marie Tobin, who also served in the Navy.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Adelbert Lorane TIBBETTS b: 27 Mar 1857 in W Concord Mn
2 CONT Mother: Nellie Jane REED b: 3 Feb 1873 in Nora Springs , Iowa
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Lucile Lyda BERGER b: 16 Dec 1897 in Oskosh, Wisconsin
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Married: 19 Jun 1919
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. Has Children Patricia Ann TIBBETTS b: Private
2 CONT    2. Has Children Reed Berger TIBBETTS b: Private
