1 NOTE Mabel was confirmed Nov 14, 1915 by Rev. Havenros.  She went to the Bondeli School.  Her mother died from the Spanish Flu in 1918 thus leaving Mabel and her sisters to take care of the household.  Mabel and Leonard took over the H
2 CONC olje Farm in 1920.  (see page 364-65 of the Maddock Diamond Jubilee book for additional information)
