1 NOTE {geni:about_me} On a family tree hand written by my grandma (Dorothy Kjorlaug Cummings) Thomas Kristofferson Nitter of Kjorlaug is the father of 8 children. These 8 children are written as Kjorlaug Farm, Hauge Farm, Sirggum (Swigg
2 CONC o) Farm, Fet Farm, Marheim Farm, Heltne Farm, Ollegaard, and Bsita (Brita?). We are unsure if the surname is Kjorlaug for all of these Farms or if the name of the Farm is the surname. 
