1 NAME Lauritz "Louis" Sevrin /Solberg/
2 GIVN Lauritz "Louis" Sevrin
2 SURN Solberg
2 _MARNM Solberg
2 NICK Louis Solberg
1 NAME Lauritz //
2 GIVN Lauritz
2 SURN Solberg
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 6 JUN 1838
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
2 DATE 25 AUG 1908
2 ADDR
3 CITY Minneapolis
3 STAE Minnesota
