1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When Edgar Oliver Lysne was born on 16 February 1903, in Elbow Lake Township, Grant, Minnesota, United States, his father, Ole K Lysne, was 29 and his mother, Emma Pauline Lökker, was 26. He married Almeda Sofriana
2 CONC  Snyder on 19 July 1927, in Galahad, Flagstaff County, Alberta, Canada. They were the parents of at least 2 daughters. He lived in Stony Brook Township, Grant, Minnesota, United States for about 10 years. He died on 17 May 1977, i
2 CONC n Galahad, Flagstaff County, Alberta, Canada, at the age of 74.
