1 NOTE {geni:about_me} (VII) Lucius Fowler, son of Dr. Nathaniel (2) Thayer, was born June 22, 1797. died December 10, 1843. He came to Westfield, Massachusetts, when a young man and purchased a large farm, which he conducted with succes
2 CONC s, acquiring a competence. He married, October 15. 1820, Lydia Ellsworth, of East Windsor, Connecticut, who died at the age of eightyfour. Children: 1. Irene Elizabeth, born October 13, 1822. 2. Adeline Maria, September 3, 1824. 3
2 CONC . Serviah H., April 4, 1827. 4. Eliza Ann, March 12, 1829. 5. Mary, August 5, 1832. 6. Lucius Fowler, mentioned below.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://books.google.com/books?pg=PA2383&lpg=PA2383&dq=Adeline+Maria+Thayer+1824&sig=3dpJxIZ9gwnd54jeR1Gikr1UjSc&ei=ASTjUKj5LenSiwLYmIH4Cw&id=FM8UAAAAYAAJ&ots=P-Sp3r6eQO&output=text
2 CONT
2 CONT Bibliographic information QR code for Genealogical and personal memoirs relating to the families of the state of Massachusetts Title	Genealogical and personal memoirs relating to the families of the state of Massachusetts, Volume 
2 CONC 4 Genealogical and Personal Memoirs Relating to the Families of the State of Massachusetts, William Frederick Adams Editors	William Richard Cutter, William Frederick Adams Publisher	Lewis historical publishing company, 1910 Origin
2 CONC al from	Harvard University Digitized	Feb 1, 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT No. 1291. II E. LUCIUS F. THAYER.
2 CONT
2 CONT Second child of Dr. Nathaniel and Sarah Thayer, married Lydia Ells- 1 worth, of East Windsor, Conn., 15 October, 1820, and settled in Westfield, Mass. An extensive farmer, and quite wealthy. Children are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Irene Elizabeth, bor n 13 Oct. 1822
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Adeline Maria, "3 Sep. 1824 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Serviah H., "4 Apr. 1827
2 CONT
2 CONT  4. Eliza Ann; bor n 12 Mar. 1829
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Mary, "-5 Aug. 1832
2 CONT
2 CONT  6. Lucius Fowler, "22 Aug. 1834
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Lucius Thayer died 10 December, 1843.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://books.google.com/books?pg=PA183&lpg=PA183&dq=Adeline+Maria+Thayer+1824&sig=ou3fLHEN6gakBV_XcQ0vWtKbZNk&ei=ASTjUKj5LenSiwLYmIH4Cw&id=kTJWAAAAMAAJ&ots=EYKcAW8AYa&output=text
2 CONT
