1 OCCU "Extraordinary Professor of Natural Philosophy" Physics professor at University of Copenhagen. Discovered electromagnetism. First to isolate aluminum. Received Copley Medal from Royal Society of England. Received principal mathema
2 CONC tical gift of the Institut
