1 NAME Lorentz Henrik Segelcke /Dietrichson/
2 GIVN Lorentz Henrik Segelcke
2 _MARNM Dietrichson
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1 JAN 1834
2 PLAC Bergen
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Norge
