2 CONT Obituary: Seattle Times Thurs. February 15, 1940
2 CONT CHRIS GREENBERG
2 CONT    Funeral Services for Chris Greenberg, 71 years old, a Seattle resident fifty-two years, will be held at 2 0'clock Saturday at the Fisher & Kalfus Funeral Home.  Burial will be in Pacific Lutheran Cemetery.  Mr. Greenberg died t
2 CONC uesday at a hospital.  His home was at 8016 14th Ave. N.W.  He was born in Norway.  
2 CONT    Mr. Greenberg was a member of Green Lake Lodge No. 149, F. & A. M.; Friendship chapter No. 40, R. A. M.: the Erickson Lodge No. 1, Sons of Norway.  Surviving are two sons, Earl, Seattle, and Bennett Greengberg, San Fransisco, a
2 CONC nd a daughter, Mrs. Esther Maddux, Los Angeles.
