1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Find A Grave
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/143993099/dorothy-lavonne-jensrud
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Bio by Langhans Funeral Home
2 CONT
2 CONT   Dorothy L Jensrud "Tootie", 89 Plaza, died Thursday, May 29, 2014 in a Minot nursing home.
2 CONT   Dorothy was born July 20, 1924 to Ernest and Fern (Camp) Thompson in Eagle Bend, Minn.  The family later moved to Esmond, ND where she graduated from high school in 1942.
2 CONT   Dorothy was united in marriage to Melvin Jensrud, November 28, 1942, in Reno, NV before they moved to Richmond, Calif. Dorothy worked as a stenographer, and Melvin as a welder, in the shipyards.  In 1943 they moved back to Esmon
2 CONC d when Melvin was drafted into the Navy.
2 CONT   In December of 1946, they moved and made Plaza their home.  Dorothy was a homemaker and was very active in her children's lives, serving as a room mother and school chaperone.  She also worked as a bookkeeper at Farmers Union fo
2 CONC r 15 years.  Around 1977, Melvin and Dorothy moved to Lisbon and then on to Devils Lake, where Melvin managed the elevators, before returning to Plaza in the late 1980's. 
2 CONT   She was a longtime member of First Lutheran Church and its Ladies Aid of Plaza.  She taught Sunday school and was a bible study leader.  She was also instrumental in starting a quilting group at the church.  Dorothy was named "O
2 CONC utstanding Woman of Plaza in 1994".  Dorothy helped implement a successful Meals-on-Wheels program in Plaza.  She was also a member of the homemakers group, the Plaza Senior Citizens and the American Legion Auxiliary.
2 CONT   Throughout her life, Dorothy gave piano lessons and was the church organist.  She also enjoyed singing in the church choir and for various community events.  She passed her love of music on to her children and grandchildren.  Sh
2 CONC e cherished spending time with her family, especially her grandchildren and great-grandchildren.  May God bless the memory of Dorothy "Tootie" Jensrud.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/143993099/dorothy-lavonne-jen
2 CONC srud Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 21 2022, 17:46:10 UTC''
