1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Peter Peterson son of Ingerbrig Peterson Quam and Johanna Eriksdatter Ladd  was born 28 June 1851 in Hafslo,Norway, and died 3 August 1927 in Eureka,Greenwood Co.,Kansas. He married Gurine Ingeborg Hagne. She was b
2 CONC orn 1857 in Valestrand,Norway, and died 23 May 1943 in Eureka,Greenwood Co.,Kansas.  
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children of Peter Peterson and Gurine Ingeborg Hagne are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Albert O. Peterson was born 21 November 1884 in Greenwood Co.,Kansas, and died 21 July 1963 in Eureka,Greenwood Co.,Kansas. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Dora J. Peterson was born 27 January 1886 in Greenwood Co.,Kansas, and died 23 April 1971 in Greenwood Co.,Kansas.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Anna Marie Peterson was born 28 August 1887, and died 19 November 1965 in Eureka,Greenwood Co.,Kansas. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Ovidia Christine Peterson was born 3 Nov 1891 in Greenwood Co.,Kansas, and died 9 October 1944 in Eureka,Greenwood Co.,Kansas. She married Benjamin H. Souders. He was born in Greenwood Co.,Kansas, and died in Eureka,Greenwood C
2 CONC o.,Kansas. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Andrew John Peterson was born 5 April 1894 in Upper Fall River,Greenwood Co.. Kansas, and died 28 August 1978 in Eureka,Greenwood Co.,Kansas.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Ella Peterson was born 13 March 1896 in Eureka,Greenwood Co.,Kansas, and died 31 December 1986 in Abilene,Kansas. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. Gilbert J.P. Peterson was born 1 September 1898 in South Salem Twp.,Greenwood Co.,Kansas, and died 13 May 1983 in Rockford,Illinois.
